@SMGS.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5169

### Login with the local sample account
POST {{SMGS.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "visitor@museum.local",
  "password": "Museum@123"
}

### Register a new account (use a new email for each successful registration)
POST {{SMGS.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newvisitor@museum.local",
  "fullName": "New Museum Visitor",
  "password": "Museum@123"
}